{
  "about": "A made-up master pipeline at its Boxes level with 54 boxes and 60 links in 8 areas, grown from the master in tests/fixtures/a-made-up-master-and-reel-in-lanes.json by a script kept outside the repository, on 16 November 2026. It keeps that master's 13 steps, the block pipeline hung on each, its 15 modules, its 8 areas and its 25 links, each record's kind, role and state, and each link's type, gate, inferred flag and ends. Twenty of its placed boxes, those with the most links first, each have a copy, box-35 to box-54, in the same block pipeline and the same area, placed after that area's last item, with the same state; \"copyOf\" names the box copied. Thirty-five more links are copies of the master's links, with one or both ends replaced by that end's copy; \"copyOf\" names the link copied by its place in \"links\". Every title, area name and carried word is made up; a title is about as long as the one it replaced, or the shortest plain one. Records are named by keys and no record id is kept. One box is stored with no state in the master it was grown from; here, as there, the office stores it as to do, since it stores no step without a state.",
